# Brainrot.com — Design System

**One-liner:** Brainrot.com is a colorful collectible toy brand living on the internet.

Reference energy: **Brainrot Wear** — light scrapbook canvas, paint splashes, thick black outlines, bubble logo, sticker characters, clean functional UI.

**NOT** neon gaming, cyberpunk, crypto, synthwave, soft lifestyle/surf, or dark SaaS.

## Light canvas (mandatory)

- Background: off-white / paper grey (`#f3f1ec`) with subtle grain/dot texture
- Color arrives as **paint explosions** (yellow / pink / purple / blue splashes), not dark neon glow
- Pure black (`#0a0a0a`) for outlines, marker highlights, sticker shadows

## Sticker language

Brand UI should feel sticker-bombed:

- Thick black borders (`3px`)
- Hard offset shadows (`4px 4px 0 #0a0a0a`) — not soft colored glow
- Occasional slight rotation
- Black marker / brush shapes behind key words
- Doodles (stars, bolts, smiles) as accents only

## Color tokens

```css
--br-bg: #f3f1ec;
--br-fg: #0a0a0a;
--br-pink: #ff2fb3;
--br-orange: #ff5a1f;
--br-yellow: #dfff00;
--br-lime: #7cff00;
--br-cyan: #00e5ff;
--br-blue: #3155ff;
--br-purple: #8b3dff;
```

## Typography

- **Brand / bubble**: Fredoka — logo, hero, Brainrot names, badges, key CTAs
- **Functional**: Nunito Sans — nav, labels, prices, forms
- Logo can use white fill + black stroke + hard shadow
- Highlight words with `MarkHighlight` (black jagged mark + pink→purple gradient text)

Do **not** cartoonize every label/form. Keep functional UI clean.

## Hierarchy

**illustration / stickers > title > CTA > secondary info**

## CTAs

Pill, saturated fill, **black outline**, hard sticker shadow. Language: `DÉCOUVRIR LA COLLECTION →`, `GENERATE BRAINROT`, `WEAR THIS`.
